# Mostly unmodified upstream ClassicUO mirror - ignored to avoid duplicating external/ClassicUO.
# A few files here are real, MobileUO2-owned overrides though (confirmed: GameScene.cs,
# GameController.cs, WorldMapGump.cs, ShopGump.cs, SpellbookGump.cs, SkillGumpAdvanced.cs,
# SystemChatControl.cs, StbTextBox.cs, OptionsGump.cs, ScrollArea.cs). Those are tracked via
# `git add -f` despite this rule - ignore patterns don't un-track a file once it's added.
# IMPORTANT: never edit a file under this path while it's still a symlink - it writes through
# into external/ClassicUO (the upstream ClassicUO submodule, not ours to modify). Convert it to
# a real file here first (rm the symlink, copy the content, git add -f), same as every entry
# in this list.
Assets/Scripts/ClassicUO/src/*
/.codedebrief/cache/
*.apk
*.keystore
MobileUO2_BurstDebugInformation_DoNotShip/
*.slnx